      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ff1040485187c56661a16acdd43895edf07c6de4291049008b600ae1245124d9"
      ],
      "text": "Monocle performs natural language searches against compiled binaries: given a binary and search criteria, it decompiles the binary and uses an in-built LLM to identify and score matching code areas."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ddff4cbb116985b5467190e07fe5b6aa3b9374378898acdd604dc2ee4846d14f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "6a865d767a9623af4e72cd1c2b9e39e62db45105",
          "git_sha": "52f91fa9b98d553b981aebb77a044f45f1579d07",
          "line_end": 20,
          "line_start": 17,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "arphanetx/monocle",
          "url": "https://github.com/arphanetx/Monocle/blob/6a865d767a9623af4e72cd1c2b9e39e62db45105/README.md#L17-L20"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ff1040485187c56661a16acdd43895edf07c6de4291049008b600ae1245124d9"
      ],
      "text": "Monocle uses Ghidra headless to enable decompilation of compiled binaries."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ee074a789ea566314b7903a3be3089380c9ae6b8acf3de770f211e90ef4f7eb2",
