        "slc_b87218fad294ae1fe5fc2ea129bb21a72631183d71fe220b353fd113bfe1ddf4"
      ],
      "text": "Monocle requires Nvidia CUDA for improved LLM performance, plus Ghidra installed with analyzeHeadless available in the environment."
    },
    {
