      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_11a5561dd00ae8db958f13bdd8bdbdf7084c0ef3374092d3b9e765328f766fcb"
      ],
      "text": "The CLI takes a binary path and a search target, e.g. monocle --binary <path-to-binary> --find <component-to-find> on Unix, with a monocle.exe variant on Windows."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_32bfd63c12fff0746c2b632a7355f98f0708c2ca567f4c156edde5fe9448abd7",
