  "summary": "Monocle is an LLM-backed binary analysis search tool that decompiles binaries via Ghidra headless and uses Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2 to score functions against natural-language search criteria. Evidence covers its purpose, CLI, dependencies, output format, and contribution guidelines.",
